# Unity Loom — line-ending policy (fixes F11: CRLF/LF budget drift)
* text=auto eol=lf

*.md   text eol=lf
*.mjs  text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.yml  text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.txt  text eol=lf

*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.webp binary
*.ico  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.zip  binary
